[[build-artifacts]]
=== Compilation artifacts

**STUB**: Specifies exactly what `morloc make` produces: the build directory
layout, the per-language pool trees, and the launchers (CLI, MCP, daemon) that
exec the shared nexus. Gives the complete manifest format field by field, how
it is versioned, and which compatibility promises it makes. Defines what
installing a built program does and where installed programs live.

